

### 不带 token 查询当前用户
GET http://localhost:8080/users/me

### 登录获取 token
POST http://localhost:8080/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 查询当前登录用户
GET http://localhost:8080/users/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjEsInVzZXJuYW1lIjoiYWRtaW4iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODI0NTQ3ODIsImV4cCI6MTc4MjU0MTE4Mn0.oroA1fwfBILyZgcsxQqRPrvlhqx_3qfZDBnhK9jSbXw
